# 🚀 Day 42–43: RAG Evaluation with Spring AI

## 📌 100 Days of AI Engineering

This project covers **RAG Evaluation** using **Spring AI**, PostgreSQL/PGVector, Ollama embeddings, and Groq/Qwen.

- **Day 42:** RAG Evaluation – Theory & Concepts
- **Day 43:** RAG Evaluation – Practical Implementation

The goal is to understand not only whether a RAG system generates an answer, but also whether it retrieves the **right information** and produces a **grounded answer**.

---

# 🧠 Day 42 – RAG Evaluation Theory

## Why Do We Need RAG Evaluation?

A RAG system can fail in two major areas:

```text
User Question
      ↓
Retrieval
      ↓
Retrieved Documents
      ↓
LLM
      ↓
Generated Answer
